asc-comm development patch package

  --install                       Install or update the Hcomm headers
  --uninstall                     Restore the headers saved before first install
  --install-path=<CANN_ROOT>       Select a CANN installation root
  --force                         Override version or file consistency checks

The default install path is ASCEND_HOME_PATH. This package is intended only for
local development verification. Recompile the target Ascend C kernel after it
is installed.
